IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `eia-core`
IMPORT `eia-core-interpretation`
IMPORT `ei6-part-8-5-access`

-- Tests of ei6-part-8-5-access (Act ss 153.15 to 153.19, src:2971-3010). Expected values are read from the text by hand.
-- September 27, 2020 and September 26, 2021 are Sundays. The first argument of most rules is "Part VIII.5 has not ceased to
-- apply under section 153.196".

§ `Section 153.15 - the definition of waiting period`

#ASSERT `s 153.15 the provision that gives the meaning of waiting period` `Part I` EQUALS JUST "subsection 6(1)"
#ASSERT `s 153.15 the provision that gives the meaning of waiting period` `Part VIII` EQUALS JUST "subsection 6(1)"
#ASSERT `s 153.15 the provision that gives the meaning of waiting period` `Part VII.1` EQUALS JUST "subsection 152.01(1)"
#ASSERT `s 153.15 the provision that gives the meaning of waiting period` `Part II` EQUALS NOTHING

§ `Section 153.16 - the rate of unemployment of 13.1%`

-- The later of the weeks of section 10(1): interruption on Wednesday September 23, 2020 (Sunday September 20), claim on
-- Monday September 28, 2020 (Sunday September 27): the later week begins September 27, 2020.
#ASSERT `s 153.16 the Sunday that begins the later of the weeks referred to in subsection 10(1)` (YMD 2020 9 23) (YMD 2020 9 28) EQUALS YMD 2020 9 27
#ASSERT `s 153.16 the Sunday that begins the later of the weeks referred to in subsection 10(1)` (YMD 2020 9 29) (YMD 2020 9 21) EQUALS YMD 2020 9 27
-- begins in the window September 27, 2020 to September 25, 2021 and 13.1% is greater: 13.1% (src:2980).
#ASSERT `s 153.16 the regional rate of unemployment that applies to the claimant` TRUE (YMD 2020 9 23) (YMD 2020 9 28) (6.5%) EQUALS 13.1%
-- the later week begins September 20, 2020: before the window.
#ASSERT `s 153.16 the regional rate of unemployment that applies to the claimant` TRUE (YMD 2020 9 21) (YMD 2020 9 22) (6.5%) EQUALS 6.5%
-- the last Sunday in the window is September 19, 2021; September 26, 2021 is after it.
#ASSERT `s 153.16 the regional rate of unemployment that applies to the claimant` TRUE (YMD 2021 9 20) (YMD 2021 9 21) (6.5%) EQUALS 13.1%
#ASSERT `s 153.16 the regional rate of unemployment that applies to the claimant` TRUE (YMD 2021 9 27) (YMD 2021 9 28) (6.5%) EQUALS 6.5%
-- the rate that would otherwise apply is higher, equal, or lower than 13.1%.
#ASSERT `s 153.16 the regional rate of unemployment that applies to the claimant` TRUE (YMD 2020 9 23) (YMD 2020 9 28) (14%) EQUALS 14%
#ASSERT `s 153.16 the regional rate of unemployment that applies to the claimant` TRUE (YMD 2020 9 23) (YMD 2020 9 28) (13.1%) EQUALS 13.1%
#ASSERT `s 153.16 the regional rate of unemployment that applies to the claimant` TRUE (YMD 2020 9 23) (YMD 2020 9 28) (13.2%) EQUALS 13.2%
-- the Part has ceased to apply.
#ASSERT `s 153.16 the regional rate of unemployment that applies to the claimant` FALSE (YMD 2020 9 23) (YMD 2020 9 28) (6.5%) EQUALS 6.5%

§ `Section 153.161 - availability for work`

#ASSERT `s 153.161(1) the claimant is not entitled to be paid benefits for the working day` TRUE TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 153.161(1) the claimant is not entitled to be paid benefits for the working day` TRUE TRUE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 153.161(1) the claimant is not entitled to be paid benefits for the working day` TRUE FALSE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 153.161(1) the claimant is not entitled to be paid benefits for the working day` FALSE TRUE TRUE)
#ASSERT `s 153.161(2) the Commission may require proof that the claimant was capable of and available for work` TRUE TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 153.161(2) the Commission may require proof that the claimant was capable of and available for work` TRUE FALSE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 153.161(2) the Commission may require proof that the claimant was capable of and available for work` TRUE TRUE FALSE)

§ `Sections 153.17 to 153.172 - additional hours`

-- Arguments: not ceased; initial claim under Part I; the day the claim is made; the day of the interruption of earnings;
-- the claim is for benefits in sections 21 to 23.3; already increased; a benefit period was established.
-- 480 hours for benefits referred to in any of sections 21 to 23.3; 300 in any other case (src:2990-2992).
#ASSERT `s 153.17 the additional hours of insurable employment the claimant is deemed to have in the qualifying period` TRUE TRUE (YMD 2020 9 27) (YMD 2020 9 20) TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST 480
#ASSERT `s 153.17 the additional hours of insurable employment the claimant is deemed to have in the qualifying period` TRUE TRUE (YMD 2020 9 27) (YMD 2020 9 20) FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST 300
-- a claim before September 27, 2020 for an interruption of earnings on or after that date.
#ASSERT `s 153.17 the additional hours of insurable employment the claimant is deemed to have in the qualifying period` TRUE TRUE (YMD 2020 9 20) (YMD 2020 9 27) FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST 300
-- both before September 27, 2020: nothing is added.
#ASSERT `s 153.17 the additional hours of insurable employment the claimant is deemed to have in the qualifying period` TRUE TRUE (YMD 2020 9 26) (YMD 2020 9 20) TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- not a claim under Part I; the Part has ceased to apply.
#ASSERT `s 153.17 the additional hours of insurable employment the claimant is deemed to have in the qualifying period` TRUE FALSE (YMD 2020 9 27) (YMD 2020 9 20) TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 153.17 the additional hours of insurable employment the claimant is deemed to have in the qualifying period` FALSE TRUE (YMD 2020 9 27) (YMD 2020 9 20) TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- (2): already increased AND a benefit period was established: no more. Already increased without a benefit period: it applies.
#ASSERT `s 153.17 the additional hours of insurable employment the claimant is deemed to have in the qualifying period` TRUE TRUE (YMD 2020 9 27) (YMD 2020 9 20) TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 153.17 the additional hours of insurable employment the claimant is deemed to have in the qualifying period` TRUE TRUE (YMD 2020 9 27) (YMD 2020 9 20) TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST 480
#ASSERT `s 153.17 the additional hours of insurable employment the claimant is deemed to have in the qualifying period` TRUE TRUE (YMD 2020 9 27) (YMD 2020 9 20) TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST 480
-- 153.171 (src:2996) and 153.172 (src:2998)
#ASSERT `s 153.171 the claimant may make a claim for benefits under sections 21 to 23.3 although not a major attachment claimant` TRUE TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 153.171 the claimant may make a claim for benefits under sections 21 to 23.3 although not a major attachment claimant` TRUE FALSE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 153.171 the claimant may make a claim for benefits under sections 21 to 23.3 although not a major attachment claimant` TRUE TRUE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 153.171 the claimant may make a claim for benefits under sections 21 to 23.3 although not a major attachment claimant` FALSE TRUE TRUE)
#ASSERT `s 153.172 the claimant may make a request under section 112 to receive benefits under the Fishing Regulations rather than under section 7` TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 153.172 the claimant may make a request under section 112 to receive benefits under the Fishing Regulations rather than under section 7` TRUE FALSE)

§ `Section 153.18 - extension of the qualifying period`

-- Arguments: not ceased; the day of the initial claim; the day of the interruption of earnings; received the benefit or
-- CERB in the qualifying period; already extended (src:3002-3006).
#ASSERT `s 153.18 the number of weeks by which the qualifying period is extended` TRUE (YMD 2020 9 27) (YMD 2020 9 20) TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST 28
#ASSERT `s 153.18 the number of weeks by which the qualifying period is extended` TRUE (YMD 2020 9 20) (YMD 2020 9 27) TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST 28
#ASSERT `s 153.18 the number of weeks by which the qualifying period is extended` TRUE (YMD 2020 9 26) (YMD 2020 9 26) TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 153.18 the number of weeks by which the qualifying period is extended` TRUE (YMD 2020 9 27) (YMD 2020 9 20) FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 153.18 the number of weeks by which the qualifying period is extended` TRUE (YMD 2020 9 27) (YMD 2020 9 20) TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 153.18 the number of weeks by which the qualifying period is extended` FALSE (YMD 2020 9 27) (YMD 2020 9 20) TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- 28 weeks (196 days) before Sunday September 27, 2020 is Sunday March 15, 2020; the period ends where it did.
#ASSERT `s 153.18 the qualifying period as extended` (JUST 28) (`Period of days` OF (YMD 2020 9 27), (YMD 2021 9 25)) EQUALS `Period of days` OF (YMD 2020 3 15), (YMD 2021 9 25)
#ASSERT `s 153.18 the qualifying period as extended` NOTHING (`Period of days` OF (YMD 2020 9 27), (YMD 2021 9 25)) EQUALS `Period of days` OF (YMD 2020 9 27), (YMD 2021 9 25)

§ `Section 153.19 - late claims`

#ASSERT `s 153.19 the fact is good cause for a delay in making a claim for the benefits` TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 153.19 the fact is good cause for a delay in making a claim for the benefits` TRUE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 153.19 the fact is good cause for a delay in making a claim for the benefits` FALSE TRUE)
